1843+ 77AF F1               pop  af
1844+ 77B0 CB 3F            srl  a
1845+ 77B2 CB 3F            srl  a
1846+ 77B4 CB 3F            srl  a
1847+ 77B6 CB 3F            srl  a                  ; Sposta i 4 bit superiori in quelli inferiori (GGGG)
1848+ 77B8 32 9F EA         ld   (room_gravity_preset), a
